      <profiles>
        <profile name="Communion Helm" id="5717-72cb-c405-92eb" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Once during each of this operative&apos;s activations, you can do one of the following:
- Spend 1 Communion point for free.
- Spend 1 Communion point and select one friendly VESPID STINGWING operative within 3&quot; of this operative. That other friendly operative can immediately perform a free 1AP mission action (you must still spend a Communion point for it to perform that action as normal, and this cannot be ignored using the Convergence Stimulant equipment).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Commune" id="09ab-7f18-eb5f-c319" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">When selecting your operatives for the battle, also select one **VESPID STINGWING** strategy ploy. Whenever this operative is in the killzone and not within control range of an enemy operative, that ploy costs you 0CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
