          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">While this operative has a Conceal order, your opponent cannot select it as a valid target unless it&apos;s within 6&quot; of the operative trying to target it. Note that this rule has no effect if this operative is not selected as the valid target, e.g. if it&apos;s a secondary target from the Blast weapon rule.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Camouflaged" id="60fa-0b60-141b-ee1e" hidden="false" typeId="f887-5881-0e6d-755c" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">Whenever an operative is shooting this operative, ignore the Piercing weapon rule and all cover saves are retained as critical successes. This rule has no effect if this operative is not selected as the valid target, e.g. if it&apos;s a secondary target from the Blast weapon rule.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
